Z||000001||Raydar||08-05-2001||10:24 AM||||It's STILL a cool thing to look at.<BR>The Fiero, as a commuter car, is an excellent choice for electric power. <BR>Our company has (had?) a leasing program for EV1s, and used to have one on display in our lobby. Two seats. Plastic body panels. Kinda reminded me of a Fiero. <BR>Would have leased an EV1 but didn't have room to park it, and didn't want to sell anything to make room. With tax credits and such, it would have ended up being very reasonable.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||14
