Z||000003||fiero56||08-05-2001||12:09 PM||||Just think how much crap those batteries are going to unleash on the environment once they are no good. EVs (IMHO) are the worst alternative to fossil fuel come up with or put into production to date. "But the car doesn't put out any pollution." All the pollution is created making the batteries, charging them, and then they continue to pollute one their intended life-span is up.||||reg||1
